<html>
   <head>
      <title>Philly Budget Data</title>
      <%- include('_meta', { basePath: '' }) %>
   </head>
   <body>
      <%- include('_menu') %>
      <main>
         <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 pt-20 pb-16 text-center lg:pt-32">
            <h1 class="mx-auto italic max-w-4xl font-display text-5xl font-medium tracking-tight text-slate-900 sm:text-7xl">
               Philly <span class="text-blue-800">Budget</span> Data
            </h1>
            <p class="mx-auto mt-6 max-w-2xl text-lg tracking-tight text-slate-700">
               This website provides both visualizations of the Philadelphia city budget as well as raw budget data from 2016 - 2026.
            </p>
         </div>
         <section class="bg-slate-50 py-12 lg:py-12">
            <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 md:text-center">
               <h2 class="font-display text-3xl tracking-tight text-slate-900 sm:text-4xl">Longitudal budget view</h2>
               <p class="mt-4 text-lg tracking-tight text-slate-700">
               <p>This visualization shows Philadelphia budget data dating back to 2018. It is a copy of <a class="text-blue-800" href="https://ny-budget.datamade.us">NY Budget</a> by the brilliant folks at <a class="text-blue-800" href="https://datamade.us">Datamade</a>.</p>
               <div class="py-12 flex justify-center">
                  <a href="/datamade"><img class="max-w-3xl" src="./assets/images/datamade.jpg" alt="a longitudal view of the city budget"></a></div>
               </div>

            </div>
         </section>
         <section class="py-12 lg:py-20">
            <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
               <div class="mx-auto max-w-2xl md:text-center">
                  <h2 class="font-display text-3xl tracking-tight text-slate-900 sm:text-4xl">Open Budget bubble charts</h2>
                  <p class="mt-4 text-lg tracking-tight text-slate-700">The following charts are built off the the City of Philadelphia's <a class="text-blue-800" href="https://github.com/CityOfPhiladelphia/open-budget">open budget</a> implementation, based on a project by <a class="text-blue-800" href="https://github.com/tpreusse/open-budget">OpenData.ch</a>, the Swiss division of the <a class="text-blue-800" href="http://okfn.org/" rel="nofollow">Open Knowledge Foundation</a>.</p>
               </div>
            <div class="lg:mt-20 mt-8 lg:block">
               <div class="grid grid-row md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-x-8 grid-cols-1 justify-items-center" role="tablist" aria-orientation="horizontal">
                  <div class="relative py-6">
                     <a href="charts/bubble/2027.ejs">
                        <img class="h-85" src="assets/images/2027-proposed.jpg" />
                        <h3 class="font-display mt-2 text-slate-900 text-xl">2027 Proposed Budget</h3>
                     </a>
                  </div>
                  <div class="relative opacity-75 hover:opacity-100 py-6">
                     <a href="charts/bubble/2027-by-fund.ejs">
                        <img class="h-85" src="assets/images/2027-proposed-by-fund.jpg" />
                        <h3 class="font-display mt-2 text-slate-900 text-xl">2027 Proposed Budget by Funding Source</h3>
                     </a>
                  </div>
                  <div class="relative opacity-75 hover:opacity-100 py-6">
                     <a href="charts/bubble/2026-tagged.ejs">
                        <img class="h-85" src="assets/images/2026-tagged.jpg" />
                        <h3 class="font-display mt-2 text-slate-900 text-xl">2026 Adopted Budget</h3>
                     </a>
                  </div>
                  <div class="relative opacity-75 hover:opacity-100 py-6">
                     <a href="charts/bubble/2026-by-fund.ejs">
                        <img class="h-85" src="assets/images/2026-by-fund.jpg" />
                        <h3 class="font-display mt-2 text-slate-900 text-xl">2026 Budget by Funding Source</h3>
                     </a>
                  </div>
                  <div class="relative opacity-75 hover:opacity-100 py-6">
                     <a href="charts/bubble/2018.ejs">
                        <img class="h-85" src="assets/images/2018-proposed-by-fund.jpg" />
                        <h3 class="font-display mt-2 text-slate-900 text-xl">2018 Proposed Budget by Funding Source</h3>
                     </a>
                  </div>
               </div>
            </div>
         </section>
         <section class="bg-slate-50 py-12 lg:py-20">
            <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
               <div class="mx-auto max-w-2xl md:text-center">
                  <h2 id="about" class="font-display text-3xl tracking-tight text-slate-900 sm:text-4xl">About this website</h2>
                  <p class="py-4">The goal of this website is to provide data and visual artifacts to better understand the city budget. It is created by <a class="text-blue-800 underline" href="https://github.com/acouch">acouch</a>, is <a class="text-blue-800 underline" href="https://github.com/acouch/phila-budget-site">open source</a>, and builds off of previous open source budget tools. The author particpated in the <a class="text-blue-800 underline" href="https://www.peoplesbudgetoffice.org/pb-study-group">People's Budget Working Group</a>.</p>
                  <p class="py-4"><a class="text-blue-800 underline" href="https://thenounproject.com/icon/budget-7824210/">Budget icon from the noun project.</a></p>
               </div>
            </div>
         </section>
         <section class="py-12 lg:py-20">
            <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
               <div class="mx-auto max-w-2xl md:text-center">
                  <h2 id="budget" class="font-display text-3xl tracking-tight text-slate-900 sm:text-4xl">About Philly's Budget</h2>
                  </div>
                <div class="py-12">
                  <img src="./assets/images/budget-timeline.jpg" alt="a visual of the city budget cycle"/>
                  <p class="py-8">The city budget is a year-round process with very limited opportunities for public input. See the <a class="text-blue-800 underline" href="https://www.peoplesbudgetoffice.org/">People's Budget Office</a> for more information.</p>
               </div>
            </div>
         </section>
         <section class="bg-slate-50 py-20 py-12 lg:py-20">
            <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
               <div class="mx-auto max-w-2xl md:text-center">
                  <h2 id="resources" class="font-display text-3xl tracking-tight text-slate-900 sm:text-4xl">Resources</h2>
               </div>
               <div class="max-w-screen-xl mx-auto p-5 sm:p-10 md:p-16">
                  <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-10">
                    <!-- begin resource cards-->
                     <div class="rounded overflow-hidden shadow-lg">
                        <a href="#"></a>
                        <div class="relative">
                           <a style="display: block; background-color: hsl(243.4, 52.2%, 13.1%); padding: 20px;" href="https://www.peoplesbudgetoffice.org/">
                              <img elementtiming="nbf-header-logo-desktop" src="./assets/images/peoplesbudgetoffice.jpg" alt="People&amp;#39;s Budget Office " style="display:block" fetchpriority="high" loading="eager" decoding="async" data-loader="raw">
                              <div
                                 class="hover:bg-transparent transition duration-300 absolute bottom-0 top-0 right-0 left-0 bg-gray-900 opacity-25">
                              </div>
                           </a>
                        </div>
                        <div class="px-6 py-4">
                           <a href="#"
                              class="font-semibold text-lg inline-block hover:text-indigo-600 transition duration-500 ease-in-out">People's Budget Office</a>
                           <p class="text-gray-500 text-sm">
                              A wealth of resources and events about the city budget.
                           </p>
                        </div>
                     </div>
                     <div class="rounded overflow-hidden shadow-lg">
                        <a href="#"></a>
                        <div class="relative">
                           <a style="display: block; padding: 20px;" href="https://data.phila.gov/visualizations/payments-aggregate/">
                              <img elementtiming="nbf-header-logo-desktop" src="./assets/images/citypaymentsdashboard.jpg" alt="City payments dashboard" style="display:block" fetchpriority="high" loading="eager" decoding="async" data-loader="raw">
                              <div
                                 class="hover:bg-transparent transition duration-300 absolute bottom-0 top-0 right-0 left-0 bg-gray-900 opacity-25">
                              </div>
                           </a>
                        </div>
                        <div class="px-6 py-4">
                           <a href="#"
                              class="font-semibold text-lg inline-block hover:text-indigo-600 transition duration-500 ease-in-out">City's Payment Dashboard</a>
                           <p class="text-gray-500 text-sm">
                              An up-to-date dashboard of the city's payments.
                           </p>
                        </div>
                     </div>
                     <div class="rounded overflow-hidden shadow-lg">
                        <a href="#"></a>
                        <div class="relative">
                           <a style="display: block; padding: 20px;" href="https://www.economyleague.org/resources/philadelphias-fy2027-budget-new-commitments-household-tradeoffs-and-thinner-fiscal">
                              <img elementtiming="nbf-header-logo-desktop" src="./assets/images/elbudgetdash.jpg" alt="economy league dashboard" style="display:block" fetchpriority="high" loading="eager" decoding="async" data-loader="raw">
                              <div
                                 class="hover:bg-transparent transition duration-300 absolute bottom-0 top-0 right-0 left-0 bg-gray-900 opacity-25">
                              </div>
                           </a>
                        </div>
                        <div class="px-6 py-4">
                           <a href="#"
                              class="font-semibold text-lg inline-block hover:text-indigo-600 transition duration-500 ease-in-out">Economy League Budget Dashboard</a>
                           <p class="text-gray-500 text-sm">
                              A budget analysis by the Economy League of Philadelphia.
                           </p>
                        </div>
                     </div>
                     <div class="rounded overflow-hidden shadow-lg">
                        <a href="#"></a>
                        <div class="relative">
                           <a style="display: block; padding: 20px;" href="https://drive.google.com/file/d/1Ki7M2JnG7TStbD3OwS72oE0flvkwCDOn/view">
                              <img elementtiming="nbf-header-logo-desktop" src="./assets/images/pboreport.jpg" alt="Cover of PBO report on equitable budgeting" style="display:block" fetchpriority="high" loading="eager" decoding="async" data-loader="raw">
                              <div
                                 class="hover:bg-transparent transition duration-300 absolute bottom-0 top-0 right-0 left-0 bg-gray-900 opacity-25">
                              </div>
                           </a>
                        </div>
                        <div class="px-6 py-4">
                           <a href="#"
                              class="font-semibold text-lg inline-block hover:text-indigo-600 transition duration-500 ease-in-out">Building an equitable budgeting process for Philadelphia Report</a>
                           <p class="text-gray-500 text-sm">
                             A review of contemporary practices and recommendations created by the People's Budget Working Group.
                           </p>
                        </div>
                     </div>
                  </div>
                  <p></p>
               </div>
            </div>
         </section>
      </main>
   </body>
</html>